Residual destinations, contaminants and evidence for use (@wu-residual-destinations: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @water-and-sanitation, #water-and-sanitation "Nutrient-recovery-has-purity-yield-and-market-boundaries.lingua#r_6R8KJS0MEHN25HM49Z3CF8F09T") { r_3BSDN0JETZ28RT8RN9KYS33DEH
**Read:** Complete the destination and management material in [Sludge Treatment and Disposal — Andreoli, von Sperling and Fernandes](../sources/Sludge-Treatment-and-Disposal.lingua#r_01W2VM1NE64Y1FDRJRM0RYKYY4); use [Sanitation safety planning — WHO, second edition](../sources/Sanitation-Safety-Planning-WHO.lingua#r_2FF0R519TGR5RNY3EVV7APPZ86) and [Faecal Sludge Management — Strande, Ronteltap and Brdjanovic](../sources/Faecal-Sludge-Management-Eawag.lingua#r_2CSTH41F4C2WWARQ7X0ZF5NNGY) to connect exposure and the complete service chain. Retrieve the current local requirements for the actual proposed receiving route before making any real decision.

Calling a material a biosolid, fertilizer, recovered product or fuel does not establish its suitability. Source history, pathogens, chemical contaminants, stability, physical handling and exposure conditions all matter. A treatment that improves one attribute can concentrate another constituent into a smaller mass. Meeting one numerical test is not proof of every required property.

**Work:** Compare hypothetical land use, thermal processing and disposal routes using a declared acceptance specification and evidence. Map sampling locations, variability, storage, transport and responsible decisions. Account for a rejected batch and loss of the usual receiving facility. Distinguish removal from the environment, redistribution and transformation; do not assign a benefit merely because the material leaves the plant.

For research depth, investigate a specific contaminant's fate using primary measurements and an explicit detection-limit account. Compare destruction, transfer and unmeasured transformation products. Keep a mass balance and exposure argument together, including uncertainty. This documentary investigation does not authorize handling or applying real residuals.

**Continue:** [Nutrient recovery has purity, yield and market boundaries](Nutrient-recovery-has-purity-yield-and-market-boundaries.lingua#r_6R8KJS0MEHN25HM49Z3CF8F09T).
